{"id":193,"date":"2026-09-30T22:56:08","date_gmt":"2026-09-30T22:56:08","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/theseventhrealm.com\/en\/"},"modified":"2026-10-01T00:18:55","modified_gmt":"2026-10-01T00:18:55","slug":"en","status":"publish","type":"page","link":"https:\/\/theseventhrealm.com\/en\/","title":{"rendered":"The Seventh Realm"},"content":{"rendered":"<p><!-- \u300cEN\u300d\u82f1\u6587\u5165\u53e3\u9875\u6b63\u6587\uff08v1 \u8349\u7a3f\uff09\uff1a\u6a2a\u5e45\/\u5bfc\u822a\/\u9875\u811a\u7531\u5b50\u4e3b\u9898\u6a21\u7248\u7edf\u4e00\u8f93\u51fa\uff0c\u6b64\u5904\u53ea\u653e\u6b63\u6587 --><br \/>\n<!-- \u4f5c\u7528\u57df .en\uff1a\u4ec5\u8986\u76d6\u300c\u5b57\u4f53\u53d8\u91cf + \u5b57\u8ddd\u300d\uff0c\u4e0d\u6539\u5e03\u5c40\u3002\u5168\u7ad9\u9ed8\u8ba4\u5c45\u4e2d\uff08qijing.css L24 + .prose{margin:0 auto}\uff09\uff0c\u82f1\u6587\u9875\u8ddf\u968f\u5c45\u4e2d --><\/p>\n<style>\n\/* \u82f1\u6587\u9875\u53ea\u9700\u6362\u6389\u6bdb\u7b14\u5b57\u4f53\u53d8\u91cf\u4e0e\u5b57\u8ddd\uff1b\u5e03\u5c40\u6cbf\u7528\u7ad9\u70b9\u540c\u540d class\uff0c\u96f6\u4e3b\u9898\u6539\u52a8 *\/\n.en{--f-brush:'EB Garamond','Iowan Old Style',Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif}\n.en .hero{text-align:center}\n.en .hero h1{font-size:clamp(30px,5.4vw,54px);letter-spacing:.04em}\n.en .hero .zi-top{letter-spacing:.34em;padding-left:.34em;font-size:clamp(11px,1.5vw,13px)}\n.en .hero .subtitle{letter-spacing:.06em;font-size:clamp(15px,2.1vw,19px)}\n.en .hero .subtitle span{margin:0 6px}\n.en h2{letter-spacing:.05em;font-size:clamp(22px,3vw,30px)}\n.en .prose{margin:0 auto;text-align:center;max-width:720px}\n.en .brush{margin:12px auto 28px;display:block}\n.en .prose p{letter-spacing:0;line-height:1.85;font-size:clamp(16px,2.1vw,18.5px)}\n.en .prose ul{margin:14px auto;max-width:680px;list-style:none;padding:0}\n.en .prose li{letter-spacing:0;font-size:clamp(16px,2.1vw,18.5px);margin:8px 0}\n.en .btn-row{margin:30px 0 6px;display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:14px;align-items:center;justify-content:center}\n.en .btn-main{display:inline-block;padding:13px 30px;border:1px solid var(--ink);color:var(--ink);\n  font-family:var(--f-brush);font-size:17px;letter-spacing:.08em;transition:background .35s ease,color .35s ease}\n.en .btn-main:hover{background:var(--ink);color:#fff}\n.en .btn-note{font-size:14px;color:var(--ink2);letter-spacing:0}\n.en .honest{border-top:1px solid rgba(26,26,24,.14);padding:16px 0 0;margin-top:22px;color:var(--ink2);max-width:680px;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto}\n.en .mark{color:var(--cinnabar);font-weight:600}\n<\/style>\n<div class=\"en\">\n<header class=\"hero\">\n<p class=\"zi-top\">A \u00b7 VISUAL \u00b7 RECORD<\/p>\n<h1>The Seventh Realm<\/h1>\n<p class=\"subtitle\"><span>Five thousand years,<\/span><span>one character at a time.<\/span><\/p>\n<div><span class=\"seal\">\u4e03\u5883\u4e4b\u5370<\/span><\/div>\n<p>  <span class=\"scroll-hint\">Scroll<\/span><br \/>\n<\/header>\n<section class=\"reveal\">\n<h2>What this is<\/h2>\n<p>  <svg class=\"brush\" viewBox=\"0 0 200 14\" preserveAspectRatio=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n    <path d=\"M3 8 C 26 5, 52 11, 84 8 C 126 4, 160 10, 197 7 C 168 12, 126 14, 92 11 C 58 9, 26 12, 3 8 Z\"\/>\n  <\/svg><\/p>\n<div class=\"prose\">\n<p>An independent project, run by <span class=\"mark\">one individual creator<\/span>, tracing five thousand years of Chinese history through two things: how a single Chinese character was written across three millennia, and how each dynasty saw itself.<\/p>\n<p>Nothing here is generated by AI. The forms are drawn from source material, and ancient script is copied from the artefacts \u2014 not invented.<\/p>\n<p class=\"honest\">This is a personal reading, not an academic institution. Where sources are contested, the disagreement is left visible rather than smoothed over.<\/p>\n<\/p><\/div>\n<\/section>\n<section class=\"reveal\">\n<h2>Take something with you<\/h2>\n<p>  <svg class=\"brush\" viewBox=\"0 0 200 14\" preserveAspectRatio=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n    <path d=\"M3 8 C 26 5, 52 11, 84 8 C 126 4, 160 10, 197 7 C 168 12, 126 14, 92 11 C 58 9, 26 12, 3 8 Z\"\/>\n  <\/svg><\/p>\n<div class=\"prose\">\n<p>Thirty-two phone wallpapers, made from ink on paper. <strong>Free, no account, no email required<\/strong> \u2014 take them and use them.<\/p>\n<div class=\"btn-row\">\n      <a class=\"btn-main\" href=\"https:\/\/theseventhrealm.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/09\/wallpaper-jinju-32-v2.zip\">Download all 32 &middot; 5.5 MB<\/a><br \/>\n      <span class=\"btn-note\">ZIP \u00b7 phone-sized \u00b7 no sign-up<\/span>\n    <\/div>\n<p>The character series is the other half of the work: one character followed through oracle bone script, bronze inscription, seal, clerical and regular script. That series is being released gradually.<\/p>\n<\/p><\/div>\n<\/section>\n<section class=\"reveal\">\n<h2>What&#8217;s inside<\/h2>\n<p>  <svg class=\"brush\" viewBox=\"0 0 200 14\" preserveAspectRatio=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n    <path d=\"M3 8 C 26 5, 52 11, 84 8 C 126 4, 160 10, 197 7 C 168 12, 126 14, 92 11 C 58 9, 26 12, 3 8 Z\"\/>\n  <\/svg><\/p>\n<div class=\"prose\">\n<p>The site itself is written in Chinese. These are the parts worth knowing about:<\/p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Five Thousand Years<\/strong> \u2014 a continuous record across sixteen dynasties, from the legendary age to the end of the imperial era. <em>(Chinese)<\/em><\/li>\n<li><strong>Dao Jing<\/strong> \u2014 notes on the idea that runs underneath the whole project. <em>(Chinese)<\/em><\/li>\n<li><strong>The Collection<\/strong> \u2014 downloadable works and editions. <em>(Chinese)<\/em><\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p class=\"honest\">English coverage is thin for now. It will grow \u2014 but I would rather show you one clear page than a machine-translated mirror of the whole site.<\/p>\n<\/p><\/div>\n<\/section>\n<section class=\"reveal\">\n<h2>Stay in touch<\/h2>\n<p>  <svg class=\"brush\" viewBox=\"0 0 200 14\" preserveAspectRatio=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n    <path d=\"M3 8 C 26 5, 52 11, 84 8 C 126 4, 160 10, 197 7 C 168 12, 126 14, 92 11 C 58 9, 26 12, 3 8 Z\"\/>\n  <\/svg><\/p>\n<div class=\"prose\">\n<p>Want the character series as each one comes out? <strong>Write to me<\/strong> and I will add you to the list \u2014 no form, no tracking, just a reply when there is something new.<\/p>\n<div class=\"btn-row\">\n      <a class=\"btn-main\" href=\"mailto:hello@theseventhrealm.com?subject=Add%20me%20to%20the%20character%20series\">hello@theseventhrealm.com<\/a><br \/>\n      <span class=\"btn-note\">One address, read by a person.<\/span>\n    <\/div>\n<p class=\"honest\">Prefer to write in Chinese? The same address works. For licensing, prints, translation or collaboration, say so in the subject line.<\/p>\n<\/p><\/div>\n<\/section>\n<\/div>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>A \u00b7 VISUAL \u00b7 RECORD The Seventh Realm Five thousand yea [&hellip;]<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":2,"featured_media":0,"parent":0,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"footnotes":""},"class_list":["post-193","page","type-page","status-publish","hentry"],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/theseventhrealm.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/pages\/193","targetHints":{"allow":["GET","POST","PUT","PATCH","DELETE"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/theseventhrealm.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/pages"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/theseventhrealm.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/page"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/theseventhrealm.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/2"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/theseventhrealm.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=193"}],"version-history":[{"count":2,"href":"https:\/\/theseventhrealm.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/pages\/193\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":197,"href":"https:\/\/theseventhrealm.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/pages\/193\/revisions\/197"}],"wp:attachment":[{"href":"https:\/\/theseventhrealm.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media?parent=193"}],"curies":[{"name":"wp","href":"https:\/\/api.w.org\/{rel}","templated":true}]}}